# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debugging and tracing for the latest version of Samplomatic"
msgstr "Penyahpepijatan dan penjejakan untuk versi terkini Samplomatic"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debugging and tracing"
msgstr "Penyahpepijatan dan penjejakan"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debugging and tracing {#debugging-and-tracing}"
msgstr "Penyahpepijatan dan penjejakan {#debugging-and-tracing}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") function transforms an annotated circuit into a template circuit and samplex pair. In a complex circuit it can be hard to tell which box in the original circuit corresponds to which barriers in the template, or which nodes in the samplex DAG.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") mengubah litar beranotasi menjadi pasangan litar templat dan samplex. Dalam litar yang kompleks, sukar untuk mengetahui kotak mana dalam litar asal yang sepadan dengan penghadang mana dalam templat, atau nod mana dalam DAG samplex.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Samplomatic provides two complementary tracing tools:\n"
msgstr "Samplomatic menyediakan dua alat penjejakan yang saling melengkapi:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Barrier labels**: Every barrier in the template circuit carries a label that encodes its origin. These are always present regardless of whether `debug=True` is set.\n"
msgstr "**Label penghadang**: Setiap penghadang dalam litar templat membawa label yang mengekodkan asalnya. Label ini sentiasa ada sama ada `debug=True` ditetapkan atau tidak.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Trace info on samplex nodes**: When [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") is called with `debug=True`, every samplex node carries a `TraceInfo` object linking it back to the box or boxes that produced it.\n"
msgstr "**Maklumat jejak pada nod samplex**: Apabila [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") dipanggil dengan `debug=True`, setiap nod samplex membawa objek `TraceInfo` yang memautkannya kembali kepada kotak atau kotak-kotak yang menghasilkannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Both tools are most useful when boxes carry a [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\") annotation, which attaches a `ref` string to the box. Alternatively, [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") references are also attached.\n"
msgstr "Kedua-dua alat paling berguna apabila kotak membawa anotasi [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\"), yang melampirkan rentetan `ref` pada kotak. Sebagai alternatif, rujukan [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") juga dilampirkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tag boxes {#tag-boxes}"
msgstr "Kotak tag {#tag-boxes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\") annotation attaches a `ref` string to a box. The `ref` then appears in barrier labels and in trace information on samplex nodes.\n"
msgstr "Anotasi [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\") melampirkan rentetan `ref` pada kotak. `ref` itu kemudian muncul dalam label penghadang dan dalam maklumat jejak pada nod samplex.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following example circuit has three boxes: two tagged CX boxes on disjoint qubit pairs, and an untagged right-dressed measurement box. The second CX box also carries an [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") annotation — both its `tag` ref and its noise `ref` will appear in the barrier labels. The two CX boxes cover different qubits, which enables the samplex optimizer to merge their propagation nodes into shared nodes. This is shown in the trace information section.\n"
msgstr "Contoh litar berikut mempunyai tiga kotak: dua kotak CX bertag pada pasangan qubit yang tidak bertindih, dan satu kotak pengukuran *right-dressed* tanpa tag. Kotak CX kedua turut membawa anotasi [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") — rujukan `tag` dan `ref` hingarnya akan muncul dalam label penghadang. Kedua-dua kotak CX meliputi qubit yang berbeza, yang membolehkan pengoptimum samplex menggabungkan nod perambatan mereka menjadi nod bersama. Ini ditunjukkan dalam bahagian maklumat surih.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/f6b6fe7b60a39ba897814008443fa79b66213005462ab09f49ffc89aab1f3668.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/f6b6fe7b60a39ba897814008443fa79b66213005462ab09f49ffc89aab1f3668.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/f6b6fe7b60a39ba897814008443fa79b66213005462ab09f49ffc89aab1f3668.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/f6b6fe7b60a39ba897814008443fa79b66213005462ab09f49ffc89aab1f3668.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Barrier labels in the template circuit {#barrier-labels-in-the-template-circuit}"
msgstr "Label penghadang dalam litar templat {#barrier-labels-in-the-template-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calling [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") on the circuit above produces a template whose barriers carry identifying labels. Each label has the form `{side}{scope}@{key=value&...}`:\n"
msgstr "Memanggil [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") pada litar di atas menghasilkan templat yang penghadangnya membawa label pengenalan. Setiap label berbentuk `{side}{scope}@{key=value&...}`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Side**: `L` = left-dressing boundary, `M` = inner box content boundary, `R` = right-dressing boundary.\n"
msgstr "**Sisi**: `L` = sempadan pemakaian-kiri, `M` = sempadan kandungan dalam kotak, `R` = sempadan pemakaian-kanan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Scope**: An integer index (or underscore-separated list for nested boxes) that distinguishes multiple boxes at the same nesting level.\n"
msgstr "**Skop**: Indeks integer (atau senarai dipisahkan garis bawah untuk kotak bersarang) yang membezakan beberapa kotak pada aras sarang yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Annotations**: An `@`-prefixed, `&`-separated list of `key=value` pairs derived from the box’s annotations. The `tag` key comes from a [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\") annotation and `inject_noise` comes from an [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") annotation.\n"
msgstr "**Anotasi**: Senarai pasangan `key=value` berawalan `@` dan dipisahkan `&` yang diperoleh daripada anotasi kotak. Kunci `tag` datang daripada anotasi [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\") dan `inject_noise` datang daripada anotasi [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\").\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Barriers from untagged boxes carry only the side and scope (for example, `L2`), with no `@` suffix.\n"
msgstr "Penghadang daripada kotak tidak bertag hanya membawa sisi dan skop (contohnya, `L2`), tanpa akhiran `@`.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/e533d70a29504005a636aa27306d3ce3b1d2488358ac6a53f0674f2934698ab8.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/e533d70a29504005a636aa27306d3ce3b1d2488358ac6a53f0674f2934698ab8.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/e533d70a29504005a636aa27306d3ce3b1d2488358ac6a53f0674f2934698ab8.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/e533d70a29504005a636aa27306d3ce3b1d2488358ac6a53f0674f2934698ab8.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The barrier labels can also be extracted programmatically:\n"
msgstr "Label penghadang juga boleh diekstrak secara programatik:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trace information on samplex nodes {#trace-information-on-samplex-nodes}"
msgstr "Maklumat jejak pada nod samplex {#trace-information-on-samplex-nodes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Passing `debug=True` to [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") attaches trace information to every samplex node. Each node’s [`trace_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.Node.trace_info \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.Node.trace_info\") attribute is a `TraceInfo` object whose `trace_refs` dictionary maps annotation keys (for example, `\"tag\"` and `\"inject_noise\"`) to sets of ref strings. Nodes without a corresponding box annotation have `trace_info=None`.\n"
msgstr "Menghantar `debug=True` kepada [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") melampirkan maklumat jejak pada setiap nod samplex. Atribut [`trace_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.Node.trace_info \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.Node.trace_info\") setiap nod ialah objek `TraceInfo` yang kamus `trace_refs`nya memetakan kunci anotasi (contohnya, `\"tag\"` dan `\"inject_noise\"`) kepada set rentetan ref. Nod tanpa anotasi kotak yang sepadan mempunyai `trace_info=None`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When [`draw()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-samplex#samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.draw \"samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.draw\") is called on a debug-built samplex, hovering over any node in the interactive graph reveals its `trace_refs` inside the hover tooltip.\n"
msgstr "Apabila [`draw()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-samplex#samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.draw \"samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.draw\") dipanggil pada samplex yang dibina dalam mod nyahpepijat, menuding ke atas mana-mana nod dalam graf interaktif akan mendedahkan `trace_refs`nya dalam tip alat tuding.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trace information can also be inspected programmatically. Notice that some nodes carry references from both `'cx_ab'` and `'cx_cd'`. The samplex optimizer merged their parallel propagation nodes because the two boxes cover disjoint qubits and share a common predecessor from the right-dressed measurement box’s emission.\n"
msgstr "Maklumat jejak juga boleh diperiksa secara programatik. Perhatikan bahawa sesetengah nod membawa rujukan daripada kedua-dua `'cx_ab'` dan `'cx_cd'`. Pengoptimum samplex menggabungkan nod perambatan selari mereka kerana kedua-dua kotak meliputi qubit tak bertindih dan berkongsi pendahulu sepunya daripada pemancaran kotak pengukuran berpakaian-kanan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To find all nodes that originate from a specific box, filter by the `\"tag\"` key:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mencari semua nod yang berasal daripada kotak tertentu, tapis mengikut kunci `\"tag\"`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "The samplex DAG {#the-samplex-dag}"
msgstr "DAG samplex {#the-samplex-dag}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The samplex returned by [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") is a directed acyclic graph (DAG) where **edges denote register dependency**. That is, an edge from node A to node B means B must wait for A to have acted on the shared virtual registers before B is allowed to act. This is not a temporal ordering like the DAG of a quantum circuit. Instead, the graph flows from nodes responsible for generating randomizations to nodes responsible for synthesizing them as outputs.\n"
msgstr "Samplex yang dikembalikan oleh [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") ialah graf berarah tanpa kitaran (DAG) di mana **sisi menandakan kebergantungan daftar**. Maksudnya, sisi daripada nod A ke nod B bermakna B mesti menunggu A bertindak ke atas daftar maya yang dikongsi sebelum B dibenarkan bertindak. Ini bukan tertib temporal seperti DAG litar kuantum. Sebaliknya, graf mengalir daripada nod yang bertanggungjawab menjana perawakan kepada nod yang bertanggungjawab mensintesisnya sebagai output.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are three node types, each with a distinct visual style in the interactive plot:\n"
msgstr "Terdapat tiga jenis nod, masing-masing dengan gaya visual tersendiri dalam plot interaktif:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Shape  | Color         | Type                                                                                                                                                             | Role                                                            |\n"
"| ------ | ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Star   | Red           | [`SamplingNode`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-sampling-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.SamplingNode \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.SamplingNode\")         | Instantiates new virtual registers from a distribution or input |\n"
"| Circle | Green         | [`EvaluationNode`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-evaluation-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.EvaluationNode \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.EvaluationNode\") | Transforms, combines, or propagates virtual registers           |\n"
"| Bowtie | Blue / Purple | [`CollectionNode`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-collection-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectionNode \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectionNode\") | Reads registers and writes to `sample()` outputs                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Bentuk | Warna         | Jenis                                                                                                                                                            | Peranan                                                         |\n"
"| ------ | ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Bintang | Merah         | [`SamplingNode`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-sampling-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.SamplingNode \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.SamplingNode\")         | Mewujudkan daftar maya baharu daripada taburan atau input |\n"
"| Bulatan | Hijau         | [`EvaluationNode`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-evaluation-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.EvaluationNode \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.EvaluationNode\") | Mengubah, menggabungkan, atau merambatkan daftar maya           |\n"
"| Reben | Biru / Ungu | [`CollectionNode`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-collection-node#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectionNode \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectionNode\") | Membaca daftar dan menulis ke output `sample()`                |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execution proceeds in three phases:\n"
msgstr "Pelaksanaan berlangsung dalam tiga fasa:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All sampling nodes run first (in parallel).\n"
msgstr "Semua nod persampelan dijalankan dahulu (secara selari).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Evaluation nodes run next, in topological order (parallel within each generation).\n"
msgstr "Nod penilaian dijalankan seterusnya, mengikut tertib topologi (selari dalam setiap generasi).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collection nodes run last (in parallel).\n"
msgstr "Nod koleksi dijalankan terakhir (secara selari).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The graphviz layout reflects this. Sampling nodes appear at the top, collection nodes at the bottom.\n"
msgstr "Susun atur graphviz mencerminkan hal ini. Nod persampelan muncul di bahagian atas, nod koleksi di bahagian bawah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hover tooltips {#hover-tooltips}"
msgstr "Tip alat tuding {#hover-tooltips}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every node in the interactive visualization shows a tooltip when you hover over it. The tooltip contains the following information:\n"
msgstr "Setiap nod dalam visualisasi interaktif menunjukkan tip alat apabila anda menuding di atasnya. Tip alat mengandungi maklumat berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Node class name** and its integer graph index.\n"
msgstr "**Nama kelas nod** dan indeks grafnya yang berupa integer.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Register manifests**, which registers the node instantiates, reads from, writes to, and removes. These tell you how data flows between nodes.\n"
msgstr "**Manifes daftar**, iaitu daftar yang diwujudkan, dibaca, ditulis, dan dibuang oleh nod. Ini memberitahu anda bagaimana data mengalir antara nod.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Node-specific details**, including the distribution type for sampling nodes, the operand for multiplication nodes, the template parameter indices for collection nodes, and so on.\n"
msgstr "**Butiran khusus nod**, termasuk jenis taburan bagi nod persampelan, operan bagi nod pendaraban, indeks parameter templat bagi nod koleksi, dan seterusnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Trace refs** (only when `debug=True`), which are the annotation keys and ref strings that link the node back to its originating boxes.\n"
msgstr "**Trace refs** (hanya apabila `debug=True`), iaitu kunci anotasi dan rentetan ref yang memautkan nod kembali kepada kotak asalnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clicking the plot and then hovering over individual nodes is the fastest way to understand what a given node does without reading source code.\n"
msgstr "Mengklik plot dan kemudian menuding ke atas nod individu ialah cara terpantas untuk memahami fungsi sesuatu nod tanpa membaca kod sumber.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Samplex summary {#samplex-summary}"
msgstr "Ringkasan samplex {#samplex-summary}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before examining the visualization, `print(samplex)` gives a quick text summary of the node count, required inputs, and promised outputs.\n"
msgstr "Sebelum memeriksa visualisasi, `print(samplex)` memberikan ringkasan teks pantas tentang bilangan nod, input yang diperlukan, dan output yang dijanjikan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inspect registers {#inspect-registers}"
msgstr "Periksa daftar {#inspect-registers}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Passing `keep_registers=True` to [`sample()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-samplex#samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample \"samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample\") retains the intermediate [`VirtualRegister`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/virtual-registers-virtual-register#samplomatic.virtual_registers.VirtualRegister \"samplomatic.virtual_registers.VirtualRegister\") objects that are live at the end of sampling, and stores them in `outputs.metadata[\"registers\"]`. Each register is a 2D array (shape `(num_subsystems, num_randomizations)`, with possible trailing gate-shape dimensions) of virtual group elements.\n"
msgstr "Menghantar `keep_registers=True` kepada [`sample()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-samplex#samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample \"samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample\") mengekalkan objek [`VirtualRegister`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/virtual-registers-virtual-register#samplomatic.virtual_registers.VirtualRegister \"samplomatic.virtual_registers.VirtualRegister\") perantaraan yang masih hidup pada akhir persampelan, dan menyimpannya dalam `outputs.metadata[\"registers\"]`. Setiap daftar ialah tatasusunan 2D (bentuk `(num_subsystems, num_randomizations)`, dengan kemungkinan dimensi bentuk-gate di hujung) bagi unsur kumpulan maya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is useful for verifying that virtual gates were combined correctly, or for inspecting the raw Pauli or unitary samples before they are synthesized into rotation angles.\n"
msgstr "Ini berguna untuk mengesahkan bahawa gate maya telah digabungkan dengan betul, atau untuk memeriksa sampel Pauli atau unitari mentah sebelum disintesis menjadi sudut putaran.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can view the contents of the end-state of a particular register. In the following example, the register has type [`PauliRegister`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/virtual-registers-pauli-register#samplomatic.virtual_registers.PauliRegister \"samplomatic.virtual_registers.PauliRegister\"). See the `API documentation(/apidocs/index)`\\_\\_ for details about the storage format.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh melihat kandungan keadaan akhir bagi daftar tertentu. Dalam contoh berikut, daftar itu berjenis [`PauliRegister`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/virtual-registers-pauli-register#samplomatic.virtual_registers.PauliRegister \"samplomatic.virtual_registers.PauliRegister\"). Lihat `API documentation(/apidocs/index)`\\_\\_ untuk butiran tentang format storan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "How samplex nodes map to template parameters {#how-samplex-nodes-map-to-template-parameters}"
msgstr "Bagaimana nod samplex dipetakan kepada parameter templat {#how-samplex-nodes-map-to-template-parameters}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `outputs[\"parameter_values\"]` array returned by [`sample()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-samplex#samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample \"samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample\") has shape `(num_randomizations, N)`, where `N` matches `len(template.parameters)`. Each column corresponds to one parameter in the template circuit — the i-th column fills in `template.parameters[i]`.\n"
msgstr "Tatasusunan `outputs[\"parameter_values\"]` yang dikembalikan oleh [`sample()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-samplex#samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample \"samplomatic.samplex.Samplex.sample\") mempunyai bentuk `(num_randomizations, N)`, dengan `N` sepadan dengan `len(template.parameters)`. Setiap lajur sepadan dengan satu parameter dalam litar templat — lajur ke-i mengisi `template.parameters[i]`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`CollectTemplateValues`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-collect-template-values#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectTemplateValues \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectTemplateValues\") collection nodes are the link between virtual registers and template parameters. Each such node holds index information that records which columns of the output array it writes to. This makes it possible to trace which virtual gate subsystems drive which template parameters.\n"
msgstr "Nod koleksi [`CollectTemplateValues`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/samplex-nodes-collect-template-values#samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectTemplateValues \"samplomatic.samplex.nodes.CollectTemplateValues\") ialah pautan antara daftar maya dan parameter templat. Setiap nod sedemikian memegang maklumat indeks yang merekodkan lajur tatasusunan output yang ditulisnya. Ini memungkinkan penjejakan subsistem gate maya mana yang memacu parameter templat mana.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the \\{Samplex inputs and outputs}`samplex-io` guide to learn how to bind the sampled parameter values to the template circuit and run experiments.\n"
msgstr "Lihat panduan \\{Samplex inputs and outputs}`samplex-io` untuk mempelajari cara mengikat nilai parameter yang disampel pada litar templat dan menjalankan eksperimen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic tagging {#automatic-tagging}"
msgstr "Penandaan automatik {#automatic-tagging}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When using [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\"), the `add_tags` parameter automatically adds [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\") annotations to all boxes. Three modes are available:\n"
msgstr "Apabila menggunakan [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\"), parameter `add_tags` secara automatik menambah anotasi [`Tag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/tag#samplomatic.Tag \"samplomatic.Tag\") pada semua kotak. Tiga mod tersedia:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`\"unique_instance\"`**: Assigns sequential `ref` (`t0`, `t1`, and so on) to boxes in circuit order. Every box gets a distinct `ref` regardless of its structure.\n"
msgstr "**`\"unique_instance\"`**: Menetapkan `ref` berurutan (`t0`, `t1`, dan seterusnya) kepada box mengikut susunan litar. Setiap box mendapat `ref` yang berbeza tanpa mengira strukturnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`\"unique_box\"`**: Computes a structural hash of each box’s content and assigns the same `ref` to all structurally equivalent boxes. This is useful for grouping boxes by type rather than position.\n"
msgstr "**`\"unique_box\"`**: Mengira hash struktur bagi kandungan setiap box dan menetapkan `ref` yang sama kepada semua box yang setara dari segi struktur. Ini berguna untuk mengumpulkan box mengikut jenis dan bukannya kedudukan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`\"noise_ref\"`**: Copies the `ref` from each box’s [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") annotation and only tags boxes that have one. This is useful when meaningful noise refs already exist.\n"
msgstr "**`\"noise_ref\"`**: Menyalin `ref` daripada anotasi [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") setiap box dan hanya menandakan box yang memilikinya. Ini berguna apabila noise ref yang bermakna sudah wujud.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following example applies `\"unique_instance\"` and `\"unique_box\"` to a circuit whose two CX boxes are structurally equivalent. With `\"unique_instance\"`, each gets a distinct `ref`, while with `\"unique_box\"`, they share one.\n"
msgstr "Contoh berikut menggunakan `\"unique_instance\"` dan `\"unique_box\"` pada sebuah litar yang mempunyai dua kotak CX yang setara dari segi struktur. Dengan `\"unique_instance\"`, setiap kotak mendapat `ref` yang berbeza, manakala dengan `\"unique_box\"`, kedua-duanya berkongsi satu.\n"
